{
 "duration": 69.878,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "If you're watching this alone in the dark... start a seventeen-second timer right now.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 5.5
  },
  {
   "text": "Do not blink while the clock is running. And if you hear a knock on wood near you... do not answer it.",
   "start": 6.0,
   "end": 13.2
  },
  {
   "text": "Last night, I found a note taped to my bedroom mirror. No handwriting. Just printed letters. It said: \"Whatever is standing behind your reflection only moves while the lights are off.\"",
   "start": 13.2,
   "end": 25.845
  },
  {
   "text": "I laughed it off... turned off the lamp... and looked into the dark glass.",
   "start": 25.845,
   "end": 30.14
  },
  {
   "text": "At first, there was nothing. Just my own tired face.",
   "start": 30.805,
   "end": 34.88
  },
  {
   "text": "Then, at seven seconds... the doorway behind me in the reflection went completely black. Even though my hallway light was on.",
   "start": 35.397,
   "end": 43.637
  },
  {
   "text": "At twelve seconds... something tall leaned in over my left shoulder. Its chin rested right above my collarbone. And it smiled with too many teeth.",
   "start": 43.637,
   "end": 53.32
  },
  {
   "text": "When I spun around to look behind me... the room was empty.",
   "start": 53.737,
   "end": 56.84
  },
  {
   "text": "The scariest part? The note was gone. And my phone screen flickered on by itself... showing a live camera view of the back of my own head.",
   "start": 57.337,
   "end": 65.97
  },
  {
   "text": "Your seventeen seconds are up. Don't look behind you.",
   "start": 66.235,
   "end": 69.635
  }
 ],
